hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"218","Ali bin Khashram told us, Issa, meaning Ibn Yunus, told us, on the authority of Yunus bin Yazid al-Ayli, on the authority of al-Zuhri, on the authority of Urwa, on the authority of Aisha, that The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “if he wanted to eat food while in a state of junubah, he would wash his hands and then eat.”"
